<title>GERMANY: Bund futures slightly higher, but wobbly, at start.</title>
<headline>Bund futures slightly higher, but wobbly, at start.</headline>
<text>
<p>0717 GMT - Bund futures trading slightly higher, lifted by Treasuries. Comments from Buba's Koebnick seen hinting at rate rise undermining market, early range seen 103.00 to 103.35.</p>
<p>* 6.00% July 2007 Bund 103.57, yld 5.51 pct (103.54)</p>
<p>* Sept Bund future 103.23, range so far 103.11-103.28</p>
